  "semantic": {
    "type": {
      "$description": "The type set, adopted on 2026-11-18 (Juan; proposed 2026-11-17). Display 1 to 5 (80 to 200px) in Mona Sans Display SemiBold, each also Condensed (display-condensed-*: 75% width, uppercase). Headings H1 to H6 (64 to 24px) in Mona Sans Display, Regular, Medium or SemiBold, each also in Mono (mono-h1 to mono-h6). Text XL to XS (20 to 12px) in Mona Sans, also in Mono (mono-xl to mono-xs). Headings and Display take their line height from one curve, 1 + k / size^p through H6 (1.3) and H1 (1.1); text uses 1.5. Letter spacing is 0 everywhere. qdrant.weights lists the weights a style comes in, and $value holds its default; Bold is retired. The social and Luma styles became steps of this set (typography README, Text styles).",
